; machine_start_gcode = ; ===== START G-CODE FOR ENDER 3 (PLA, 0.6mm Nozzle, 0.3mm Layer, OrcaSlicer, 10mm/s max) =====\nG90 ; Absolute positioning\nM83 ; Extruder RELATIVE mode\n; --- Pre-Heat Sequence & Homing ---\nM117 Heating Bed & Nozzle...\nM140 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[0]} ; Bed temp from OrcaSlicer variable\nM104 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; Nozzle temp from OrcaSlicer variable\nM117 Homing Axes...\nG28 ; Home all axes\nG1 Z2.0 F300 ; Lift Z slightly (10mm/s)\nM117 Waiting for Temps...\nM190 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[0]} ; Wait for bed\nM109 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; Wait for nozzle\n; --- Purge / Prime Line (Folded Z-Pattern) ---\nM117 Purge Line...\nG92 E0 ; Reset extruder\nG1 X10 Y0.5 Z0.3 F600 ; Move to first layer height and start position\nG1 E3.0 F300 ; Slow extrude 3mm to get filament flowing\n; Segment 1: Forward 25mm\nG1 X35.0 E6.0 F600 ; Extrude 6mm over 25mm\n; Wipe move: shift Y\nG1 Y1.5 F600 ; Shift Y slightly to avoid dragging nozzle\n; Segment 2: Backward 25mm\nG1 X10.0 E6.0 F600 ; Extrude another 6mm back\n; --- Post-Purge Retraction & Z-Hop (anti-string) ---\nG1 E-2.5 F1800 ; Retract 2.5mm at 30mm/s to seal nozzle\nG1 Z2.0 F300 ; Z-hop to travel clearance height\n; --- Wipe nozzle tip across purge line ---\nG1 X15.0 Y1.5 F600 ; Wipe across purge bead to shear any remaining string\nG92 E0 ; Reset extruder\nM117 Printing...\n; ===== END START G-CODE =====
